  "This link explains an intellectual dependency. It is not a claim that one contributor directly learned from another.": "这条联系说明思想上的依赖关系，并不声称某位贡献者直接向另一位学习。",
  "Supporting evidence": "支持依据",
  "CITED RELATIONSHIPS": "引用的关系",
  "A display group of distinct connections. Its path represents the group; it is not an additional claim of derivation.": "这是多条独立联系的显示分组。连线代表该组，不构成额外的推导或传承主张。",
